{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"سنن أبي داود","section":{"40":"Prescribed Punishments (Kitab Al-Hudud)"},"section_detail":{"40":{"hadithnumber_first":4351,"hadithnumber_last":4493,"arabicnumber_first":4351,"arabicnumber_last":4493,"name_native":"كتاب الحدود"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":4441,"arabicnumber":4441,"text":"حدثنا محمد بن الوزير الدمشقي، حدثنا الوليد، عن الاوزاعي، قال فشكت عليها ثيابها . يعني فشدت","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":40,"hadith":91}}]}